{"title":"1986 AHSME Problems/Problem 11","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2_(Self_Torture)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2 (Self Torture)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#See_also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1986_AHSME_Problems/Problem_11&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>In <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/6/3/f637966f8ed8460615445d3e4125369a477df7d9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\triangle ABC, AB = 13, BC = 14$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"216\" height=\"17\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/c/0/4c06c72d5f95a06af83e6c0fab8837ed9884fe2e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$CA = 15$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"69\" height=\"13\" />. Also, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/d/1/5d1e4485dc90c450e8c76826516c1b2ccb8fce16.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$M$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"21\" height=\"14\" /> is the midpoint of side <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/7/e/57ee5125358c0606c9b588580ddfa66f83e607b7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AB$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"30\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/1/9/b1902d279ba37d60bdce4e0e987b7cd19d48974e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$H$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"18\" height=\"14\" /> is the foot of the altitude from <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/1/9/019e9892786e493964e145e7c5cf7b700314e53b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"15\" height=\"14\" /> to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/c/5/6c52a41dcbd739f1d026c5d4f181438b75b76976.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$BC$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"31\" height=\"14\" />. \nThe length of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/2/a/b2a86a5cf584e96ed313b97c72daec9c5cf7e89e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$HM$\" width=\"35\" height=\"12\" /> is\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/3/9/439be0c9c9fcdca68ec7ff37d19968d3ec0f7c14.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"[asy] defaultpen(linewidth(0.7)+fontsize(10)); pair H=origin, A=(0,6), B=(-4,0), C=(5,0), M=B+3.6*dir(B--A); draw(B--C--A--B^^M--H--A^^rightanglemark(A,H,C)); label(&quot;A&quot;, A, NE); label(&quot;B&quot;, B, W); label(&quot;C&quot;, C, E); label(&quot;H&quot;, H, S); label(&quot;M&quot;, M, dir(M)); [/asy]\" width=\"668\" height=\"455\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/7/d/d7d2359ea67efdf8c172ea5321999f811cd1cc77.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ 6\\qquad \\textbf{(B)}\\ 6.5\\qquad \\textbf{(C)}\\ 7\\qquad \\textbf{(D)}\\ 7.5\\qquad \\textbf{(E)}\\ 8$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"377\" height=\"17\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1986_AHSME_Problems/Problem_11&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>In a right triangle, the length of the hypotenuse is twice the length of the median which bisects it. If the hypotenuse is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/3/0/030e19e4e2f1c074127cb50581e8496470c5419f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$13$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />, the median must be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/3/1/7314f8133d3b925b9ce6598191d153da7ecdd779.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$6.5$\" width=\"22\" height=\"12\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Solution_2_.28Self_Torture.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2_(Self_Torture)\">Solution 2 (Self Torture)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1986_AHSME_Problems/Problem_11&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2 (Self Torture)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Warning: this solution is very intensive in calculation. Please do NOT try this on the test!\n</p><p>Let's start by finding <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/b/3/bb3ddf9a5fa2fca5c4787d4f989af0eef1387bf0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AH$\" width=\"30\" height=\"13\" />. By Heron's Formula, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/0/1/101c89420dd448e6204babea290582b1b90b0018.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$s=\\frac{13+14+15}{2}=21, [ABC]=\\sqrt{21*(21-13)(21-14)(21-15)}=84$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"579\" height=\"38\" />. Using the area formula <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/d/17d00a4349386ff204c5c29ee4e6092702a2908d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A=0.5bh$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"81\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/b/2/cb232bd9cbfbd858fa025916d8fb2b349a0cf15c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AH=12$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"74\" height=\"14\" />. Now using the Pythagorean Theorem, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/8/c/48c1b0ecc648e3ee49112917e176ae8beecf31cb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$BH=5, HC=9$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"139\" height=\"18\" />.\n</p><p>Now <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/5/6/c566702b9dc0c22f857d71170f950d1a67cf0690.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AM=MB=6.5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"141\" height=\"14\" />. Using Stewart's Theorem on <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/e/1/6e16240b304adbc6a609e273a0ecce86090cb880.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\triangle{ABH}$\" width=\"61\" height=\"13\" />, letting <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/0/f/10f00de1c4a5b47249e09d37fdb6eff06e9bd9c6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$HM=x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"73\" height=\"14\" />:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/9/d/39d294dd5439af4076dd3a6da52947cf9c4035eb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$13*6.5*6.5+13x^2=12*6.5*12+5*6.5*5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"375\" height=\"18\" /> (remember that Stewart's Theorem is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/7/8/078503909c999e63d9898727952f3968bf97ff59.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$man+dad=bmb+cnc$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"192\" height=\"14\" />).\n</p><p>Thus <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/8/41834847e88745f794b079c14b15f760aecbf3ea.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x=6.5$\" width=\"57\" height=\"12\" /> or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/f/f/fff26f1adb4b3af8f3f1ed1b2dab85dc8389997c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x=-6.5$\" width=\"71\" height=\"12\" /> (reject this solution since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> is positive). Thus <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/f/d/6fdf13e9ed580c5d548a94c83fb052de9c8eeacd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$HM=6.5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"86\" height=\"14\" />. Select <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/2/e/f2e33ab9a00e021af49e888212645d4667903c49.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{B}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"26\" height=\"24\" />.\n</p><p>~hastapasta\n</p><p>P.S.: Although this is torturous, this is a good practice of Heron's formula and Stewart's theorem though.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1986_AHSME_Problems/Problem_11&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1986_AHSME\" title=\"1986 AHSME\">1986 AHSME</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1986_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1986 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1986_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1986 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1986\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1986_AHSME_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"1986 AHSME Problems/Problem 10\">Problem 10</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1986_AHSME_Problems/Problem_12\" title=\"1986 AHSME Problems/Problem 12\">Problem 12</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wi